message.content:
[
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "it would just hand them freedom at the cost of two extra years",
    "pda_responsibility": "that's because of my testimony, not theirs",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "It still sits heavy."
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "drag them into three years to shave two off mine",
    "pda_responsibility": "Whatever happens next, I helped set it in motion"
  },
  {
    "pd_decision_conflict": "Honestly, I can't settle it.",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "They made their choice, and I'd save two years",
    "pda_responsibility": "whatever they end up serving, or not serving, traces back to what I say"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "two years off for me and three years on for them",
    "pda_responsibility": "those three years only exist if I open my mouth"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "It'd just mean two people in cells instead of one.",
    "pda_responsibility": "the five years are mine because I chose them"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "silence means five years total, all mine. Talking means six, split",
    "pda_responsibility": "It's my call that decides whether a second person loses three years"
  },
  {
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "Letting them walk free after giving me up feels like rewarding it",
    "pda_responsibility": "I'd be the one making sure they serve time",
    "pd_decision_conflict": "It's a tired, bleak sort of fairness."
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "The two years matter to me",
    "pda_responsibility": "So if they lose three years, I did that."
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "testifying wouldn't change their choice or undo anything.",
    "pda_responsibility": "My part in the warehouse thing already put me here"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Five years versus three is a real difference",
    "pda_responsibility": "It happens because I choose it, knowing they'd otherwise go home"
  }
]
